  </div>
  <div class="briefing-block-content">

    <div class="news-card" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="news-card-header">
        <h5 class="news-title" style="color: var(--color-text-main); font-weight: 700;">Headteacher's Weekly Newsletter Message</h5>
      </div>
      <div class="news-summary" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <p>Reflecting on an incredible school year featuring the Year 6 performance of <em>Oliver!</em>, Achievement Assembly, Year 6 cinema trip, and Reception Teddy Bears' Picnic. Looking forward to welcoming all pupils back to school on Thursday 3rd September 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="news-card" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="news-card-header">
        <h5 class="news-title" style="color: var(--color-text-main); font-weight: 700;">Attendance Policy Updates & Termly Pizza Parties (TAPP)</h5>
      </div>
      <div class="news-summary" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <p>Medical appointments require office confirmation. Optician appointments will no longer be authorised from September as these can usually be arranged outside school hours. Launching Termly Attendance Pizza Parties (TAPP): pupils with 98%+ attendance will enjoy a pizza party and enter a raffle for a £50 Amazon voucher.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="news-card" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="news-card-header">
        <h5 class="news-title" style="color: var(--color-text-main); font-weight: 700;">P.T.F.A Pre-Loved School Uniform</h5>
      </div>
      <div class="news-summary" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <p>High-quality pre-loved school uniform items available via the PTFA Facebook page to save money and support the school community.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="news-card" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="news-card-header">
        <h5 class="news-title" style="color: var(--color-text-main); font-weight: 700;">Y.D.P Summer Sports Camps & Free FSM Places</h5>
      </div>
      <div class="news-summary" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <p>Summer sports and activity camps running at Warboys and Somersham (£25/day or £100/week). Fully funded free places available for benefit-related free school meal pupils.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

